UEp6im86SPzYadIUSs88FZT44k5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFf4h0mcJqgUJLE566yGDy0X4msaQYxvAlaldtWYEs90Q&oe=6A844240"}, {"file_name": "com.glocksoftware.horrorgame-20260114-104346.png", "id": "1910051799596938", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_1910051802930271_5093697632380196663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Em5NuhVeprkQ7kNvwF-qiqv&_nc_oc=AdrctVoAR0Xm1GCPGum3K3R0sF8uttdIYWAimnzqy_Ui7yXXZCiQv3-6ancHGKg2DdQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE9KDJs0DGCK3-j75j7e2nNW1OkmZapeEVe40ahkQ5zGw&oe=6A84559B"}, {"file_name": "com.glocksoftware.horrorgame-20260114-103557.png", "id": "1406115264546505", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_1406115267879838_2631368577935749496_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1_Jkk6wkV8IQ7kNvwFefif7&_nc_oc=AdqDKEpsrCfBxNpR1eAuxM1HnFptJnfN8xtyU5wzOeKS77a5BIC3GFAQc7jM8rMGKzc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGt3Gt25j2xmRvW6UjdpNo-3p0Hu95kaZg-7ZIkAclBbA&oe=6A843D2D"}, {"file_name": "com.glocksoftware.horrorgame-20260114-111655.png", "id": "911517787897938", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_911517791231271_4588332304987211788_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dVpPSeIpnlsQ7kNvwEfUFl5&_nc_oc=Adq4LPzrsUSbnZxyxaVf0ZDUurggWtvDBPYzU8WQxDMyB26AnhNfn8BNkeAkFiIpmVo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHleF1hG7Swh6wxj8f5LiU016nADjxJWp-S9gv2btC9jA&oe=6A844E1A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-07-18-14h53m09s181.png", "id": "24523165587385059", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821115_24523165607385057_3752300522125326141_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JrN7t7waGWgQ7kNvwG6x9GE&_nc_oc=AdqiVxeBPCoLuWcRgnD6S7a5Sjyu_gEzbrzJNxkHm0gq0NGxat4MrC2Sw1PQyrP9v8s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHs0IP_9MQv2jY64zWlPFaUOTbqQfw3nxiO03-hOKppEA&oe=6A8460C0"}, "display_name": "Forgotten Possessions", "keywords": ["horror", "stealth", "survival", "scary", "psychological"], "long_description": "**They say some things are better left forgotten. In this cabin, they are hunting you.**\n\nForgotten Possessions is a raw, physics-based VR horror experience crafted by a solo developer. No hand-holding. No safety net. Just you, your flashlight, and the crushing weight of the silence.\n\n# WHY YOU WILL FEAR THE DARK:\n\n- **Ever-Changing Nightmare:** Item locations and scares are randomized. Every run is a fresh descent into madness\u2014you never know where the next item hides or where the entity will strike.\n- **The Guardian:** A relentless AI that listens and hunts. It reacts to your noise and tracks your last known position. Silence is your only weapon.\n- **Unravel the Truth:** Explore the cabin to find hidden collectibles and piece together a dark, forgotten history. Each run reveals more of the story.\n- **Scoring Mode:** Beat your high score and test your stealth and survival skills in a franatical collecting run!\n- **Hard Story Mode:** You know all the tricks and locations but want a bigger challenge? Try the unforgiving hard mode and test your skills even more!", "short_description": "Find and collect items that tell a dark story in an abandoned log cabin, but watch out for what lurks behind you. You sneak through dark rooms against a relentless, adaptive creature. Forget combat\u2014patience and stealth are your only mission. Experience a dynamic world with randomized item locations and a reactive environment. Evade the guardian as it reacts to noise and hunts you. Piece by piece, reveal the chilling past and examine items in your personal safe room."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://glock-software.de/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Glock Software", "suppo